// ADK web UI, admin tools, Agent Engine, template bucket, template Firestore databases) are not drawn, no card
// carries `removed` or `risk`, and no dashed option / unverified link is drawn. The removal list stays in the
// decision dossier (§9.7) and in the Focus page delta (as-built cards absent from the target).
// S2 = Firestore (owner, 2026-10-20, "ok on part bien sûr firestoresession service"): SESS = ADK FirestoreSessionService
